  "description": "Desperate to feed his family, Sangyeol the pharmacist accepts the high-paying job of stealing a legendary snake's horn that's said to cure infertility. After searching all over the mountain, he finds the snake's den, only to be ambushed by its ruthless resident, Hwan. Thinking Sangyeol himself wants to get pregnant, Hwan pins him down, saying he'll gladly \"give him what he wants\"... Will Sangyeol survive the merciless snake's wrath or fall prey to the deadly pleasure? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Luscent's X-mul Danpyeonseon (X물 단편선) Collection.*",
